ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a cinema, there are 25 movie posters. The ticket seller tells the manager that most of the posters on display are for comedy movies, and a very small part are for romance movies or action movies. After the manager checks, he finds that only 3 are for action movies.\n\n[Question]\nHow many action movie posters does the manager guess before checking?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before checking, the manager guesses there are 10 action movie posters.\nB. Before checking, the manager guesses there are 20 action movie posters.\nC. Before checking, the manager guesses there are 8 action movie posters.\nD. Before checking, the manager guesses there are 25 action movie posters.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035934763018562986,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e256d6006945d28022b3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368086125,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f57cbc9023c04bf0b6215bf44ae5df13"}